# Learn's first two lessons through the real UI: Move (hold ← then →; the opponent holds still) to its
# "Lesson complete" results, Back to Learn (both marked done ✓ afterwards), then Serve (Space).
until 300 Paddle Pulse
frames 30
click =All modes
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Learn
until 60 Short interactive lessons
frames 10
save learn
click =1. Slide your paddle left and right.
until 400 =GO
frames 90
hold ArrowLeft
frames 40
release ArrowLeft
frames 20
save step-2
hold ArrowRight
frames 80
release ArrowRight
until 300 Lesson complete
frames 30
expect Lesson 1 — Move
save move-done
click =Back to Learn
until 60 Short interactive lessons
frames 10
expect Slide your paddle left and right. ✓
click =2. Put the ball in play.
until 400 =GO
frames 90
key Space 3
until 300 Lesson complete
frames 30
save serve-done
click =Back to Learn
until 60 Short interactive lessons
frames 10
expect Put the ball in play. ✓
